  unitName: Fallen Morgana (EU)
  unitId: 710166
  unitNumber: 7111
  description: "Morgana grew ever more suspicious of Merlin and his strange behavior.
    She had been plotting for quite some time and decided that now was the right
    time to set her plans into motion. She found and approached Merlin\u2019s father,
    a demon living in a pit, creating a dark contract with him in which she would
    gain an immense amount of power. After the contract had been completed Morgana
    visited Merlin and cast a dimensional imprisonment spell on him. Now that her
    master was gone, she was the most powerful magical being in Grand Gaia. The contract,
    however, came at a great cost. Her son Mordred had perished on the final battlefield,
    trying to fulfil his role in her masterplan. Having all this power, but no loved
    ones around her, Morgana was overcome with grief and despair. Using all her power,
    she decided to try opening a dimensional gate back to her fairy birth realm.
    After the pact she made with a demon, the deceiving and killing she carried out,
    her return was not certain with her innocence lost. But from that day onward,
    Morgana was never seen again."
  summonDesc: Your plotting has come to an end, Merlin! Now my power is limitless!!
  fusionDesc: My magical powers are overflowing! You will feel my flames!
  evoDesc: Your plotting has come to an end, Merlin! Now my power is limitless!!
